  "body": "Hey, first of all, thank you very much for the great update.\n\nNow to my concern. Unfortunately, there is still a problem with the importable images.\nI'll show it to \"Immich\":\n\nSo as usual Immich is shown as importable, even though it has already been imported.\n<img width=\"766\" height=\"220\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40fbcaf7-7ccf-4942-9f47-fd26b0db7519\" />\n\nNow a comparison to the one already imported.\n<img width=\"776\" height=\"479\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e20ce1cf-1d4a-43ae-b707-5aafbc2356a5\" />\n\nNow which one was newly added and doesn't work.\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"485\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e1a9df9-83b6-4f2e-8db8-01e19b1d3f3f\" />\n\nAnd finally, what it looks like theoretically in the end.\n<img width=\"156\" height=\"279\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f4890a8-0e6f-4485-8b5e-e3c9bd9bf376\" />\n\nAnd yes, I have the correct Immich \"version\" because I get regular updates.",
